{
  "about": {
    "content": [
      "I'm a Senior Software Engineer based in Boston, MA, with 15+ years of experience, and a BS and MS from <a href=\"https://www.rpi.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute\">Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute</a>. I'm happiest working on the front end, but I like understanding the whole system behind it, and I care a lot about how things look, feel, and work for the people using them.",
      "Before <a href=\"https://presence.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Presence\">Presence</a>, I spent almost six years at Amazon, working on the Alexa Speech and AWS DataSync teams. Today I'm the tech lead for a small engineering team at Presence, where we build software for delivering telehealth therapy to kids.",
      "Outside of work, I'm usually off adventuring with my husband and our sweet Pomeranian, <a href=\"https://leopoldpom.dog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external\" aria-label=\"Leopold\">Leopold</a>. We love to travel, and when I'm home you'll probably find me tending to my plant collection, bingeing a podcast, or diving into a new hobby (most recently, crochet).",
      "I'm not taking on freelance work right now, but feel free to reach out to connect or chat about a project."
    ]
  },
